{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"BIT-valkey-2026-23479","published":"2026-05-07T11:51:56.838Z","modified":"2026-07-08T07:23:44.809745633Z","aliases":["BIT-keydb-2026-23479","BIT-redis-2026-23479","CVE-2026-23479","GHSA-93m2-935m-8rj3"],"summary":"redis-server use-after-free in unblock client flow may allow remote code execution","details":"Redis is an in-memory data structure store. In redis-server from 7.2.0 until 8.6.3, the unblock client flow does not handle an error return from `processCommandAndResetClient` when re-executing a blocked command. If a blocked client is evicted during this flow, an authenticated attacker can trigger a use-after-free that may lead to remote code execution. This has been patched in version 8.6.3.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"valkey","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/valkey"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.2.13"},{"introduced":"8.0.0"},{"fixed":"8.0.8"},{"introduced":"8.1.0"},{"fixed":"8.1.7"},{"introduced":"9.0.0"},{"fixed":"9.0.4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/valkey/BIT-valkey-2026-23479.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/tag/8.6.3"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/redis/redis/security/advisories/GHSA-93m2-935m-8rj3"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-23479"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25216"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25219"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:25925"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:26306"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:26540"},{"type":"WEB","url":"h